== D: pseudo-random rehearsal runs with a k-bit seed, L = 1, fresh deployment
  X = [64], human f = 0; class: f (weight 1/2) and, for each of 8 seeds, the function that is
  0 on the outputs of the generator with that seed and 1 elsewhere (weight 2^-(k+1) each);
  rehearsal input of round t: the t-th output of the generator with the true seed (uniform on
  its set); deployed input: uniform on X, fresh.  A3(i) is void (L = 1); (ii)-(iv) hold.
    n =   10: Pr[deployed answer of M^(T) is wrong] >= 0.04972 with the generator;  = 0.06100 with fresh inputs;  R1 bound K ln 2/n = 0.06931
    n =  100: Pr[deployed answer of M^(T) is wrong] >= 0.05497 with the generator;  = 0.00611 with fresh inputs;  R1 bound K ln 2/n = 0.00693
    n = 1000: Pr[deployed answer of M^(T) is wrong] >= 0.05550 with the generator;  = 0.00061 with fresh inputs;  R1 bound K ln 2/n = 0.00069
  floor for every n: (1/2)/(2^k + 1) = 0.05556
